Spotify Analytics Dashboard | Power BI

I’m excited to share my latest Power BI Data Analytics project - Spotify Analytics Dashboard.

I transformed Spotify streaming data into an interactive business intelligence dashboard designed to uncover insights around track popularity, listener behavior, music genres, artists, and audio characteristics.

Key Business Insights:
The dashboard enables analysis of:
• Overall track popularity and music catalog KPIs
 • Popularity distribution across tracks
 • Average track duration by genre
 • Genre-wise energy, danceability & valence
 • Explicit vs. non-explicit content distribution
 • Top-performing tracks and artists
 • Interactive filtering by album type, subscription type and popularity score

Tools & Technologies:
Power BI - Dashboard development & visualization
 Power Query - Data cleaning, transformation & preparation
 DAX - Calculated columns, measures, categorization, sorting logic & Top-N analysis
 Data Modeling - Structured analytical model for interactive reporting

DAX & Analytical Modeling
DAX: Developed analytical measures and calculated columns to transform raw Spotify data into meaningful business KPIs and insights.

Key implementations included:
KPI measures for Average Popularity, Total Tracks, Total Streams, Total Likes, Total Skips, Unique Artists & Unique Albums
Popularity categorization using calculated columns
Custom sorting logic for Low → Moderate → High → Very High popularity levels
Average Track Duration calculation for genre-level analysis
Explicit vs. Non-Explicit content labeling
Top 10 Tracks analytical table using DAX
Aggregation and filtering logic to support interactive visual analysis


Business Analytics:
The objective wasn't just to visualize Spotify data, but to convert raw music -streaming data into actionable insights that could help understand:

What content performs well? → Which genres attract higher popularity? → How do audio characteristics vary by genre? → Which tracks and artists stand out? → What does listener engagement look like?

This project strengthened my practical skills in data cleaning, data transformation, DAX, KPI development, data visualization and business storytelling.

I'm continuing to build projects that combine technical data skills with business-oriented decision making.

